  cargo test --test release_pipeline_contract release_workflow_never_pushes_to_protected_main,project
close_reason: "Regression contracts landed in tests/release_pipeline_contract.rs (never-push-to-main + merge-before-tag order), revert-proof verified; workflow fix shipped earlier in PR #11."
